<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH CUP AND LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH CUP AND LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Scottish cup and</p>
<p>league matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Scottish Cup quarter-finals</p>
<p> Dundee United    4   Motherwell	   1</p>
<p> Falkirk	    2   Raith		  0</p>
<p> Greenock Morton  2   Kilmarnock	   5</p>
<p>Draw for semifinal on Monday.</p>
<p>Premier division</p>
<p> Hibernian	  1   Dunfermline	  0</p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p> Partick	    1   Airdrieonians	2</p>
<p>Division two</p>
<p> Ayr		  2   Queen of South     2</p>
<p> Clyde		3   Stranraer	    0</p>
<p> Dumbarton	  2   Berwick		2</p>
<p> Hamilton	   4   Brechin		0</p>
<p> Livingston	 1   Stenhousemuir	3</p>
<p>Division three</p>
<p> Alloa		2   Albion		 0</p>
<p> Arbroath	   3   Forfar		 3</p>
<p> Montrose	   0   East Stirling	2</p>
<p> Queen's Park     1   Inverness Thistle  2</p>
<p> Ross County	4   Cowdenbeath	  0</p>
</text>
